' ============================================================
' PHASE 1: PLANNING AND ANALYSIS (FEBRUARY 2026)
' ============================================================
-- Phase 1: Planning and Analysis --

[Requirement Gathering] as [REQ] lasts 7 days
[REQ] starts 2026-02-01

[Feasibility Study] as [FEAS] lasts 5 days
[FEAS] starts at [REQ]'s end

[Tech Stack Selection] as [TECH] lasts 4 days
[TECH] starts at [FEAS]'s end

[Project Setup and Git Repo] as [SETUP] lasts 5 days
[SETUP] starts at [TECH]'s end

[M1: Requirements Frozen] happens at [SETUP]'s end

' ============================================================
' PHASE 2: SYSTEM DESIGN (LATE FEBRUARY - EARLY MARCH)
' ============================================================
-- Phase 2: System Design --

[DFD Level 0 and Level 1 Diagrams] as [DFD] lasts 5 days
[DFD] starts at [SETUP]'s end

[UML Class and Activity Diagrams] as [UML] lasts 5 days
[UML] starts at [DFD]'s end

[Database Schema Design] as [DBSCHEMA] lasts 4 days
[DBSCHEMA] starts at [UML]'s end

[M2: Design Complete] happens at [DBSCHEMA]'s end

' ============================================================
' PHASE 3: BACKEND DEVELOPMENT (MARCH 2026)
' ============================================================
-- Phase 3: Backend Development --

[FastAPI Project Setup] as [FAPI] lasts 3 days
[FAPI] starts at [DBSCHEMA]'s end

[SQLAlchemy Models and Alembic Migrations] as [MODELS] lasts 5 days
[MODELS] starts at [FAPI]'s end

[JWT Authentication - Login Signup Refresh] as [AUTH] lasts 5 days
[AUTH] starts at [MODELS]'s end

[Product and Order REST APIs] as [PRODAPI] lasts 6 days
[PRODAPI] starts at [AUTH]'s end

[Cart Wishlist and Reviews APIs] as [CARTAPI] lasts 5 days
[CARTAPI] starts at [PRODAPI]'s end

[Admin and Seller Endpoints] as [ADMINAPI] lasts 4 days
[ADMINAPI] starts at [CARTAPI]'s end

[M3: Backend MVP Ready] happens at [ADMINAPI]'s end

' ============================================================
' PHASE 4: FRONTEND DEVELOPMENT (APRIL 2026)
' ============================================================
-- Phase 4: Frontend Development --

[React Vite Setup and Routing] as [REACT] lasts 3 days
[REACT] starts at [ADMINAPI]'s end

[Auth Context and Login Pages] as [AUTHUI] lasts 4 days
[AUTHUI] starts at [REACT]'s end

[Home Product List and Detail Pages] as [PRODUI] lasts 5 days
[PRODUI] starts at [AUTHUI]'s end

[Cart and Checkout Pages] as [CARTUI] lasts 5 days
[CARTUI] starts at [PRODUI]'s end

[3D Car Garage with Three.js] as [GARAGE] lasts 6 days
[GARAGE] starts at [CARTUI]'s end

[Admin Dashboard UI] as [ADMINUI] lasts 5 days
[ADMINUI] starts at [GARAGE]'s end

[M4: Frontend MVP Complete] happens at [ADMINUI]'s end

' ============================================================
' PHASE 5: INTEGRATION AND AI MODULE (EARLY MAY 2026)
' ============================================================
-- Phase 5: Integration and AI Module --

[AI Recommendation Engine - OpenRouter] as [AI] lasts 5 days
[AI] starts at [ADMINUI]'s end

[Parts Sync Service from Remote Feeds] as [SYNC] lasts 4 days
[SYNC] starts at [AI]'s end

[Email Service SMTP and OTP] as [EMAIL] lasts 3 days
[EMAIL] starts at [SYNC]'s end

[AWS S3 Image Upload Integration] as [S3] lasts 2 days
[S3] starts at [EMAIL]'s end

[M5: AI Integration Complete] happens at [S3]'s end

' ============================================================
' PHASE 6: TESTING AND DEPLOYMENT (LATE MAY 2026)
' ============================================================
-- Phase 6: Testing and Deployment --

[Unit and Integration Testing] as [TEST] lasts 5 days
[TEST] starts at [S3]'s end

[Bug Fixes and UI Polish] as [BUGFIX] lasts 4 days
[BUGFIX] starts at [TEST]'s end

[Documentation and Deployment] as [DEPLOY] lasts 5 days
[DEPLOY] starts at [BUGFIX]'s end

[M6: Production Ready] happens at [DEPLOY]'s end

